														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-1493155">
									

<p>ADANA, depending on how clever you want me to seem, is either named after Theophilus of Adana, the main character of the first known &quot;deal with the devil&quot; story, or a coolish word I saw on the wikipedia article for &quot;deal with the devil&quot;. In universe, it's probably a random word ( I'll admit I know nothing about intelligence, but I think the millitary usually chose random names for things so people can't guess what they are.)</p>

