														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-1493218">
									

<p>At least in the world of civilian intelligence agencies, codewords are generally randomly generated (often by computer these days), and (unlike in fiction) rarely have any relation at all to the thing to which they refer. In fact, it is not unheard of for a codeword to be rejected if it is too closely related to the thing to which they refer. This, however, is one of those generally accepted breaks from reality.</p>

