														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-1884828">
									

<p>Just wanted to add that the original short story version of &quot;To Serve Man&quot; (possibly also the <em>Twilight Zone</em> version, but I've not seen it) used a version of this. Aliens swept in and gave us &quot;solutions&quot; to our problems that conveniently made us entirely dependent on them (for instance, a solution to war that also knocked out anything based on an internal combustion engine), then exploited that to get us to emigrate en masse to their world, where we'd be eaten.</p>

